@startuml
!theme plain
title IoT Temperature Monitoring System - Sequence Diagramm

actor "ESP8266" as ESP #1E88E5
participant "Mosquitto\nMQTT Broker" as MQTT #43A047
participant "Bridge\n(Python)" as BRIDGE #FFB300
database "PostgreSQL" as DB #E53935
participant "Backend\n(Flask)" as API #8E24AA
actor "Web\nFrontend" as WEB #8E24AA

' === Normale Datenübertragung ===
== Temperaturdatenübertragung ==

ESP -> MQTT: MQTT Connect (TLS, Port 8883)\nmit Benutzername/Passwort
activate MQTT
MQTT --> ESP: Connack (verbunden)

loop Alle 5 Sekunden
    ESP -> MQTT: Publish sensor/temperatur\n{"temp":24.78,"unit":"celsius",...}
    activate MQTT
    MQTT --> ESP: Puback (bestätigt)
    deactivate MQTT
    
    MQTT -> BRIDGE: Forward Nachricht
    activate BRIDGE
    BRIDGE -> BRIDGE: JSON Schema Validierung
    
    BRIDGE -> DB: INSERT INTO sensor_data\n(device_id, temperature, ...)
    activate DB
    DB --> BRIDGE: INSERT OK
    deactivate DB
    
    BRIDGE --> MQTT: ACK
    deactivate BRIDGE
end

' === Status & Heartbeat ===
== Statusüberwachung ==

ESP -> MQTT: Publish status/ESP8266_MAX6675\n{"status":"online","rssi":-52}
MQTT -> BRIDGE: Forward Status
BRIDGE -> DB: UPDATE device_status\nSET last_seen = NOW()

' === Last Will & Testament ===
== LWT (bei Absturz) ==

ESP -[#red]-> MQTT: Verbindung abbricht\n(Stromausfall/Absturz)
MQTT -> BRIDGE: Publish status/.../will\n"offline" (automatisch!)
BRIDGE -> DB: UPDATE device_status\nSET status = 'offline'

' === API & Frontend ===
== Web Dashboard ==

WEB -> API: GET /api/latest
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM sensor_data\nORDER BY received_at DESC LIMIT 1
DB --> API: {temp:24.78, timestamp:...}
API --> WEB: JSON Response
deactivate API

WEB -> API: GET /api/history?hours=24
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM sensor_data\nWHERE received_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '24 hours'
DB --> API: [100+ Datensätze]
API --> WEB: JSON Array
deactivate API

WEB -> WEB: Chart.js Visualisierung

' === Provisioning (neues Gerät) ===
== Erstmalige Inbetriebnahme ==

ESP -> MQTT: Connect (ohne Credentials)\nPort 1883 (temporär)
ESP -> MQTT: Publish devices/+/provisioning/request\n{"mac_address":"AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF"}

MQTT -> PROV: Forward Request
activate PROV
PROV -> DB: INSERT INTO devices\n(device_id, mac_address, status='pending')
PROV -> PROV: Generate MQTT Credentials\n& TLS Certificates
PROV -> DB: UPDATE devices SET\nmqtt_username, mqtt_password_hash

PROV -> MQTT: Publish devices/+/provisioning/response\n{"mqtt_username":"device_...","mqtt_password":"..."}
MQTT -> ESP: Forward Credentials
ESP -> ESP: Save Credentials\n(in EEPROM/Flash)

ESP -> MQTT: Disconnect
ESP -> MQTT: Reconnect mit neuen Credentials\n(Port 8883 mit TLS)
deactivate PROV

note over ESP
    **Provisioning abgeschlossen**
    Gerät ist jetzt registered
end note

@enduml